+    "## Getting started with bombcell"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "#### Install bombcell"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "Create a conda environment\n",
+    "```bash\n",
+    "conda create -n bombcell python=3.11\n",
+    "conda activate bombcell\n",
+    "```\n",
+    "Clone latest bombcell repository from github\n",
+    "```bash\n",
+    "git clone https://github.com/Julie-Fabre/bombcell.git\n",
+    "```\n",
+    "Install bombcell from local repository\n",
+    "```bash\n",
+    "cd bombcell/pyBombCell\n",
+    "# you could do `pip install .`, but uv is much quicker!\n",
+    "pip install uv\n",
+    "uv pip install . # or uv pip install -e . (-e for editable mode)\n",
+    "```"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "#### Imports"
+   ]
+  },
